The runtime half (main 2026-10-12T00:17:07Z): a crates/gravity row with carry leader is declared through leader_tls!
(crates/_support/leader_tls: `leader_tls::leader_tls! { thread_local! { .. } }`; release builds expand to the plain block,
debug builds raise ERROR XX000 at any access inside a pool claim) or is a row of ../LEADER-TLS-DEBT, which only
shrinks (planted20 neither, planted24 a new debt row, clean10 an old one stays); leader_tls! declares leader (or test)
statics only (planted21); a declared static's debt row goes (planted22); a debt row of no leader row goes (planted23);
